---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Contact
metaTitle: "Contact Joel Dyter, Cabinet Maker, Hebden Bridge | Enquiries"
description: "Start your project with Joel Dyter. Send an enquiry with photos, WhatsApp or call 07801 720712. Workshop at Pennine Industrial Estate, Hebden Bridge HX7 7BZ."
permalink: /contact/
---
{%- from "partials/icons.njk" import icon -%}
<header class="page-hero page-hero--plain">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="eyebrow">Contact</p>
    <h1 class="page-title">Tell me about your project</h1>
    <p class="lede">Tell me a little about what you have in mind. Photos of the space, rough measurements and an idea of budget all help, but a short description is a perfectly good place to start. I read and reply to every enquiry myself.</p>
  </div>
</header>
<section class="section section--tight">
  <div class="container contact">
    <form class="form" action="{{ site.formAction }}" method="post" enctype="multipart/form-data" data-enquiry-form data-demo-hosts="{{ site.demoHosts | join(',') }}">
      <div class="form__row form__row--2">
        <label class="field"><span>Your name <i aria-hidden="true">*</i></span><input name="name" autocomplete="name" required></label>
        <label class="field"><span>Email <i aria-hidden="true">*</i></span><input name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" required></label>
      </div>
      <div class="form__row form__row--2">
        <label class="field"><span>Phone</span><input name="phone" type="tel" autocomplete="tel"></label>
        <label class="field"><span>Postcode of the property</span><input name="postcode" autocomplete="postal-code"></label>
      </div>
      <div class="form__row form__row--2">
        <label class="field"><span>What's the project? <i aria-hidden="true">*</i></span>
          <select name="project" required>
            <option value="">Choose one</option>
            <option>Kitchen</option><option>Bathroom</option><option>Wardrobes, cupboards or shelving</option><option>Furniture</option><option>Staircase</option><option>Windows or doors</option><option>Commercial</option><option>Something else</option>
          </select>
        </label>
        <label class="field"><span>Rough budget</span>
          <select name="budget">
            <option value="">Prefer not to say</option>
            <option>Under £5,000</option><option>£5,000 to £15,000</option><option>£15,000 to £30,000</option><option>£30,000 to £50,000</option><option>£50,000+</option><option>Not sure yet</option>
          </select>
        </label>
      </div>
      <label class="field"><span>When would you like it done?</span>
        <select name="timescale">
          <option value="">No fixed date</option>
          <option>As soon as possible</option><option>Within 3 months</option><option>3 to 6 months</option><option>6 to 12 months</option><option>Just planning for now</option>
        </select>
      </label>
      <label class="field"><span>Tell me about it <i aria-hidden="true">*</i></span><textarea name="message" rows="6" required placeholder="The room, the style you like, anything that must stay, rough measurements…"></textarea></label>
      <label class="field field--file"><span>Photos or drawings <small>(optional, up to 5 files, 20MB in total)</small></span><input name="photos[]" type="file" accept="image/*,.pdf,.heic" multiple data-file-input></label>
      <p class="field__hint" data-file-hint></p>
      <div class="hp" aria-hidden="true"><label>Leave this empty<input name="website" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off"></label></div>
      <input type="hidden" name="started" value="" data-started>
      <label class="check"><input type="checkbox" name="consent" value="yes" required><span>I'm happy for Joel to use these details to reply to my enquiry. They won't be shared with anyone else.</span></label>
      <div class="form__actions">
        <button class="btn" type="submit" data-submit>Send enquiry</button>
        <p class="form__status" role="status" aria-live="polite" data-status></p>
      </div>
    </form>

    <aside class="contact__aside">
      <div class="contact-card">
        <h2 class="contact-card__title">Prefer to chat?</h2>
        <p>WhatsApp is often the quickest way to reach me, and you can send photos of the room straight from your phone.</p>
        <a class="btn btn--wa btn--block" href="{{ site.whatsapp | whatsappHref(site.whatsappMessage) }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">{{ icon("whatsapp") }} Message on WhatsApp</a>
        <ul class="contact-list">
          <li>{{ icon("phone", 18) }} <a href="{{ site.phone | telHref }}">{{ site.phone }}</a></li>
          <li>{{ icon("mail", 18) }} <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="contact-card">
        <h2 class="contact-card__title">Workshop</h2>
        <address>{{ site.address.line1 }}<br>{{ site.address.line2 }}<br>{{ site.address.town }}, {{ site.address.county }}<br>{{ site.address.postcode }}</address>
        <p class="small">Visits by appointment. I'm often out fitting, so please call or message first.</p>
        <a class="text-link" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query={{ ('Joel Dyter Cabinet Maker, ' + site.address.line1 + ', ' + site.address.town + ' ' + site.address.postcode) | urlencode }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open in Google Maps</a>
      </div>
    </aside>
  </div>
</section>
